# ==== T-FMT-C · author blank before a `case` ARM header — the CASE face of the
# clause-header class
#
# The blank-before-clause fix covered the eight `elif:`/`else:` sites. A `case`
# arm header is the same kind of thing — written by its own emit site, not by
# `format_block_stmts`, which is why the statement loop cannot see a blank above
# it — and the arm loops had no check. The result was visible ASYMMETRY inside a
# single `match`: the blank the author left above `case 2:` was deleted while
# the blank above the sibling `else:` survived.
#
# SITE AXIS (4 cells + negatives): statement-match `case` · expression-match
#   `case` · `meta match` `case` · `select` `case`. Three of the four carry a
#   `case`→`case` NEGATIVE — a second arm with no blank above it, which must stay
#   contiguous — so a fix that emits a blank unconditionally REDs in the same
#   file. The `select` cell's negative is its `case`→`else` transition instead
#   (a third select arm needs a third channel for no extra coverage).
#
# ⚠ Every cell's blank is above a `case`, NOT above the trailing `else`. The
#   `else` blanks are `clause_sites_blank.gg`'s axis and were already preserved;
#   pinning one here would be green for a reason unrelated to this fixture's
#   name. That is why the `select` cell carries TWO channels: a one-arm select
#   has no second `case` to put a blank above.
#
# ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING, as at every other clause site: blank check ->
# `emit_comments_before` -> the header. Reversed, a blank / `# note` / `case`
# run comes out comment-then-blank and the comment detaches from the arm it
# documents.
#
# The anchor is the arm's own start (the pattern for a match arm, the case
# expression for `meta match`, the arm span for `select`) — all on the arm's own
# source line, which is what the backward walk needs.
#
# RED pre-fix (recorded 2026-08-11, break-and-restore on the arm-loop blank
#   checks): every blank cell lost its blank — the four arms came out contiguous,
#   which is the reported snag. The NEGATIVES were green pre-fix and are the
#   other half of the pin: make the arm loops call `blank_line()`
#   unconditionally and they RED with a blank the author never wrote.

void stmt_match_case(int x):
    match x:
        case 1:
            print(1)

        case 2:
            print(2)
        case 3:
            print(3)

        else:
            print(0)

int expr_match_case(int x):
    int r = match x:
        case 1:
            10

        case 2:
            20
        case 3:
            30
        else:
            40
    return r

String meta_match_case[T]():
    meta match typename(T):
        case "int":
            return "i"

        case "bool":
            return "b"
        case "String":
            return "s"
        else:
            return "o"

void select_case():
    Channel[int] ch = Channel[int](1)
    Channel[int] other = Channel[int](1)
    ch.send(1)
    select:
        case int v = ch.recv():
            print(v)

        case int w = other.recv():
            print(w)
        else:
            print(0)
    ch.close()
    other.close()

void main():
    stmt_match_case(2)
    print(expr_match_case(2))
    print(meta_match_case[int]())
    select_case()
